{{!
    @template local_coursewizard/history

    Chat history of the guided course creation dialog: answered steps with their
    answers, once all required steps are answered a prominent card to create the
    course right away, then the question of the current step.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * answered - Answered steps: index, question, answer.
    * createnow - Message of the card to create the course now, empty to hide the card.
    * question - Question of the current step.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "answered": [
            {"index": 0, "question": "Wie soll dein neuer Kurs heissen?", "answer": "Excel Grundlagen"}
        ],
        "createnow": "Das Wichtigste ist erledigt. Du kannst den Kurs jetzt anlegen oder noch ein paar freiwillige Angaben machen.",
        "question": "Möchtest du deinen Kurs kurz beschreiben? Das ist freiwillig."
    }
}}
{{#answered}}
    <div class="coursewizard-msg coursewizard-msg-bot">{{question}}</div>
    <div class="coursewizard-msg coursewizard-msg-user">
        <span class="coursewizard-answer">{{answer}}</span>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-link btn-sm p-0 coursewizard-edit" data-action="edit" data-step="{{index}}">
            {{#str}}edit{{/str}}
        </button>
    </div>
{{/answered}}
{{#createnow}}
    <div class="coursewizard-create">
        <p class="coursewizard-create-text">{{createnow}}</p>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" data-action="create">
            {{#str}}createnow, local_coursewizard{{/str}}
        </button>
    </div>
{{/createnow}}
<div class="coursewizard-msg coursewizard-msg-bot">{{question}}</div>
